{"ID":"20240504161429-42pcg9d","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504161429-42pcg9d","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504161429-42pcg9d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620110654-1zjvbe3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607131941-fmof8h6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620110543-iguwbun\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"082石龙刍（龙须草、灯心草、灯芯草）","type":"doc","updated":"20240808084319"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240716154113-qlzs2no","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716154113-qlzs2no","updated":"20240716154113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于江苏、四川、福建等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈细圆柱形，长达90cm，直径1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3mm，表面白色或淡黄白色。置放大镜下观察，有隆起的细纵纹及海绵样的细小孔隙；微有光泽。质轻柔软，有弹性，易拉断，断面不平坦，白色。气味不显著。\n【性味】\t甘、淡，微寒。\n【功效】\t利水通淋；清心降火。主治：淋病；水肿；小便不利，尿少涩痛；湿热黄疸；心烦不寐；小儿夜啼；喉痹；口舌生疮；创伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240716154113-q5z2n3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716154113-q5z2n3l","updated":"20240716154113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206104700-qan0q3j.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240620110654-1zjvbe3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620110654-1zjvbe3","updated":"20240620110654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 380px;","style":"width: 370px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240620110654-qq3rzvb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 370px;\" parent-style=\"width: 380px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240620105928-i64xgom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620105928-i64xgom","updated":"20240716154411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 508px;","style":"width: 498px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙刍3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙刍3-20240620105928-qlrjcnx.webp"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 498px;\" parent-style=\"width: 508px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 543px;","style":"width: 533px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240620110556-33u0al8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 533px;\" parent-style=\"width: 543px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240620105851-746f9cs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620105851-746f9cs","updated":"20240808084250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 517px;","style":"width: 507px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙刍1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙刍1-20240620105851-nnugaq9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 507px;\" parent-style=\"width: 517px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240620110025-3ssrdo3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620110025-3ssrdo3","updated":"20240808084247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 470px;","style":"width: 460px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙刍4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙刍4-20240620110025-rke3h38.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 460px;\" parent-style=\"width: 470px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 667px;","style":"width: 657px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙刍"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙刍-20240620105814-r6c868x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 657px;\" parent-style=\"width: 667px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240620110543-iguwbun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620110543-iguwbun","updated":"20240808084259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 397px;","style":"width: 387px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"灯心草 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/灯心草 3-20240716155603-rt4zpsi.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 387px;\" parent-style=\"width: 397px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 885px;","style":"width: 875px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"灯心草 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/灯心草 4-20240716155616-yea97u3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 875px;\" parent-style=\"width: 885px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716155741-xxr57iz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716155741-xxr57iz","updated":"20240808084305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 846px;","style":"width: 836px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"灯心草 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/灯心草 8-20240716160141-jkoy8k7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 836px;\" parent-style=\"width: 846px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 433px;","style":"width: 423px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"灯心草 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/灯心草 5-20240716155741-zz3palo.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 423px;\" parent-style=\"width: 433px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716160109-y52n4cr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716160109-y52n4cr","updated":"20240808084310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 906px;","style":"width: 896px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"灯心草 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/灯心草 1-20240716155425-v3thsjc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 896px;\" parent-style=\"width: 906px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 381px;","style":"width: 371px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"灯心草 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/灯心草 7-20240716160109-ljp7qai.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 371px;\" parent-style=\"width: 381px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240620110901-ua3s7lc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620110901-ua3s7lc","updated":"20240808084316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 598px;","style":"width: 588px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙刍5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙刍5-20240620110543-ta0dviw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 588px;\" parent-style=\"width: 598px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 666px;","style":"width: 656px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"灯心草 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/灯心草 6-20240716155937-4d3n29u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 656px;\" parent-style=\"width: 666px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716154654-7rtq6qh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716154654-7rtq6qh","updated":"20240808084319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 598px;","style":"width: 588px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"灯心草"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/灯心草-20240716154654-x0ycxlf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 588px;\" parent-style=\"width: 598px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 673px;","style":"width: 663px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"灯心草 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/灯心草 2-20240716155509-lcs1wra.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 663px;\" parent-style=\"width: 673px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240617082429-0d08qlh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617082429-0d08qlh"}},{"ID":"20240617082600-fq5pqzh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617082600-fq5pqzh","updated":"20240617082605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240617082600-m20t0ir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082600-m20t0ir","updated":"20240617082600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082600-uj9aaiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082600-uj9aaiw","updated":"20240617082600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主心腹邪气，小便不利，淋闭，风湿，鬼注，恶毒。久服，补虚羸，轻身，耳目聪明，延年。一名龙须，一名草续断，一名龙珠。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082600-ixjxm2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082600-ixjxm2d","updated":"20240617082600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：龙刍，一名龙多，一名龙须，一名续断，一名龙本，一名草毒，一名龙华，一名悬莞，神农李氏小寒，雷公黄帝苦无毒，扁鹊辛无毒，生梁州，七月七日采（《御览》此条，误附续断）。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082600-529skt1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082600-529skt1","updated":"20240617082600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名龙华，一名悬莞，一名草毒，生梁州湿地，五月七月，采茎，暴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082600-xxspfwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082600-xxspfwq","updated":"20240617082658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《广雅》云：龙木，龙须也；《中山经》云：贾超之山，其中多龙修；郭璞云：龙须也，似莞而细，生山石穴中，茎列垂，可以为席；别录云：一名方宾；郑樵云：《尔雅》所为鼠莞也，旧作*，非。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082717-lxus8e9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617082717-lxus8e9"}},{"ID":"20240617082718-6j3x2mx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617082718-6j3x2mx","updated":"20240617082723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240617082718-lfpwq32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082718-lfpwq32","updated":"20240617082718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦，微寒，无毒。主治心腹邪气，小便不利，淋闭，风湿，鬼疰，恶毒。久服补虚羸，轻身，耳目聪明，延年。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082718-67l19vg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082718-67l19vg","updated":"20240617082718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（石龙刍一名龙须草，近道水石处皆有之，生于缙云者佳，故又名缙云草。苗丛生直上，并无枝叶，状如棕心草。夏月茎端作小穗，开花结细实，赤色。吴人多栽莳之以织席。）"}]},{"ID":"20240617082718-znsyxr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082718-znsyxr6","updated":"20240617082718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍气味苦寒，生于水石间，得少阴水精之气化，故以龙名。又，龙能行泄其水精也，主治心腹邪气者，少阴水精之气，上交于心，则心腹之邪气可治也。小便不利，淋闭者，热邪下注而病淋，浊气不化而仍闭结，皆为小便不利。龙刍能启水精之气，上交于心，上下相交，则小便自利矣。又，少阴神气外浮，则能去风湿。少阴神气五内，则能除鬼疰也。又曰∶恶毒者，言鬼疰之病，皆恶毒所为，非痈毒也。久服则水火相济，故能补虚羸而轻身。精神充足，故耳目聪明而延年。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082729-he8yhai","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617082729-he8yhai"}},{"ID":"20240617082731-7fqf560","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617082731-7fqf560","updated":"20240617082740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240617082731-j9i9zzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082731-j9i9zzt","updated":"20240617082731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"微温，无毒．补内虚不足，治痞满，身无润泽，出汗，除茎中热痛，杀鬼疰恶名龙珠，一名龙华，一名悬莞，一名草毒．九节多味者，良．生梁州湿地．五月、曝干．又，石龙 一名方宾，主治蛔虫及不消食尔．"}]},{"ID":"20240617082731-4f402cq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082731-4f402cq","updated":"20240617082743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶石龙刍，味苦，微寒．主心腹邪气，小便不利，淋闭风湿，鬼注恶毒．久服，补虚羸，轻身，耳目聪明，延年。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082704-rm29qd9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617082704-rm29qd9"}},{"ID":"20240617082705-v2fcpvk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617082705-v2fcpvk","updated":"20240617082709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240617082705-33f5wl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082705-33f5wl5","updated":"20240617082705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微寒、微温，无毒。主治心腹邪气，小便不利，淋闭，风湿，鬼疰，恶补内虚不足，治痞满，身无润泽，出汗，除茎中热痛，杀鬼疰恶毒瓦斯。久服补虚羸，轻身，耳目聪明，延年。一名龙须，一名草续断，一名龙珠，一名龙华，一名悬莞，一名草毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082705-j8oslcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082705-j8oslcg","updated":"20240617082832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云：茎青细相连，实赤。今出近道水石处，似东阳龙须以作席者，但多节尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082429-v55zly4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617082429-v55zly4"}},{"ID":"20240617082450-m82sj05","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617082450-m82sj05","updated":"20240617082459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240617082450-nsisiqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082450-nsisiqq","updated":"20240617082450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微寒，微温，无毒。主心腹邪气，小便不利，淋闭，风湿，鬼疰恶毒。补内虚不足，疗痞满，身无润泽，出汗。除茎中热痛，杀鬼疰恶毒瓦斯。久服补虚羸，轻身，耳目聪明，延年。一名龙须，一名草续断，一名龙朱，一名龙华，一名悬梦，一名草毒。九节多味者，良。生梁州山谷湿地。五月七月采茎，曝干。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082429-wi093jm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617082429-wi093jm"}},{"ID":"20240617082440-d9wn00f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617082440-d9wn00f","updated":"20240617082445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240617082440-82wgz98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082440-82wgz98","updated":"20240617082440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名龙须，即席草"}]},{"ID":"20240617082440-rsyf5ik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082440-rsyf5ik","updated":"20240617082440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦微寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082440-ywvt171","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082440-ywvt171","updated":"20240617082440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主心腹邪气，小便不利，淋闭，风湿，鬼疰。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082440-8c8znyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082440-8c8znyg","updated":"20240617082440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"龙刍生水中，性专利水。《本经》所主心腹邪气，亦是因水湿潴积所致，其败席治淋及小便不通。昔人用以煮服，莫若烧灰酒服更良。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082429-763mzxv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617082429-763mzxv"}},{"ID":"20240617082430-ewbx232","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617082430-ewbx232","updated":"20240617082435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240617082430-fouto22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082430-fouto22","updated":"20240617082430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍，名龙须。织席堪用，通小便不利，热淋除，内伤不足虚痞，杀鬼疰恶物，去尿管涩痛，润皮毛枯槁，却心腹邪气。败席煎汤，治淋亦效。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082358-ykjd7oq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617082358-ykjd7oq"}},{"ID":"20240617082420-8c1rumj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617082420-8c1rumj","updated":"20240617082424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240617082420-cx4r5ps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082420-cx4r5ps","updated":"20240617082420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即龙须草．通淋．"}]},{"ID":"20240617082420-5ht5mmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082420-5ht5mmu","updated":"20240617082420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦微寒．治小便淋闭．茎中热痛．败席．主治略同．取弥败有垢者方尺．煮汁服．"}]},{"ID":"20240617082358-x98wqw6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617082358-x98wqw6"}},{"ID":"20240617082410-9zxpnip","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617082410-9zxpnip","updated":"20240617082414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240617082410-hevgy8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082410-hevgy8f","updated":"20240617082410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即龙须草。味苦微寒，通淋止痛。败席有垢者功胜。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082358-ju4bqhn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617082358-ju4bqhn"}},{"ID":"20240617082359-dtpidqh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617082359-dtpidqh","updated":"20240617082404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"龙须草《本草纲目拾遗》"}]},{"ID":"20240617082359-tn1vs72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082359-tn1vs72","updated":"20240617082359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"野席草乌龙须"}]},{"ID":"20240617082359-fx7nf5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082359-fx7nf5n","updated":"20240617082359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名叉鸡草，绿袍草，铁线草，铁线筒，人字草。似扁蓄而小，细圆，与纲目石龙刍别。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082359-uy6t0tq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082359-uy6t0tq","updated":"20240617082359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"百草镜云∶生山泽谷雨后发苗，与野席草相类，但席草之叶直上，此草横生布地，小满时抽茎，开花青细。德胜堂传方∶棒槌草，亦名丫鸡草，治跌打。汪连方∶瓯人以此织席，有石龙刍、草龙刍之名，后讹刍为须，土产者即叉鸡草。又名鹿跑草，治一切疮疥，至真织席龙须，其性温和，散风火，大理湿热。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082359-htlg8e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082359-htlg8e3","updated":"20240617082359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治口咽诸毒，火症牙痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082322-9mtf7ka","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617082322-9mtf7ka"}},{"ID":"20240617082349-3a127e3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617082349-3a127e3","updated":"20240617082353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240617082349-6l3lg6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082349-6l3lg6k","updated":"20240617082349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微寒、微温，无毒。主心腹邪气，小便不利，淋闭，风湿，鬼疰，恶毒。补内虚不足，疗痞满，身无润泽，出汗，除茎中热痛，杀鬼疰恶毒瓦斯。久服补虚羸，轻身，耳目聪明，延年。一名龙须，一名草续断，一名龙珠，一名龙华，一名悬莞，一名草毒。九节多味者，良。生梁州山谷湿地。五月、七月采茎，曝干。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082349-325fkme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082349-325fkme","updated":"20240617082349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茎青细相连，实赤，今出近道水石处，似东阳龙须；以作席者，但多节尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082349-6cfzvf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082349-6cfzvf7","updated":"20240617082349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕《别录》云∶一名方宾，主疗蛔虫，及不消食尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082322-cmyovq2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617082322-cmyovq2"}},{"ID":"20240617082340-nl32ydh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617082340-nl32ydh","updated":"20240617082344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240617082340-w4bf1m9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082340-w4bf1m9","updated":"20240617082340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微寒，微温，无毒。主心腹邪气，小便不利，淋闭，风湿，鬼疰恶毒，补内虚不足，痞满，身无润泽，出汗，除茎中热痛，杀鬼疰恶毒瓦斯。久服补虚羸，轻身，耳目聪明，延年。一名龙须，一名草续断，一名龙珠，一名龙华，一名悬莞，一名草毒。九节多味者良，生梁州山谷湿地。五月、七月采茎，曝干。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082340-uxiccqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082340-uxiccqi","updated":"20240617082340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶茎青细相连，实赤，今出近道水石处，似东阳龙须以作席者，但多节尔。唐本注云∶《别录》云，一名方宾。主疗蛔虫及不消食尔。今按别本注云∶《别录》云微温，今之服用能除热，盖不温也。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶茎如 ，丛生，俗名龙须草。今人以为席者，所在有之。八月、九月采根，曝干。陈藏器云∶按龙须作席，弥败有垢者，取方尺煮汁服之。主淋及小便卒不通。今出汾州，亦处处有之。"}]},{"ID":"20240617082323-wv06v94","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617082323-wv06v94"}},{"ID":"20240617082327-qlkyozk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617082327-qlkyozk","updated":"20240617082332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240617082327-p9g8qmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617082327-p9g8qmu","updated":"20240617082327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生水石处，俗名龙须草，可作席，所在有之。味苦，寒，无毒。利小便，通淋闭，除心腹邪热，风湿，鬼疰恶毒，痞满，饮食不消，出汗，止茎中痛，杀蛔虫。久服补虚羸，明耳目，轻身延年。凡败破席受人气多者，皆消瘀血，通淋，利小便。煮服良。蒲席、灯心席俱好。九节多味者良。七月采茎，曝干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131848-ar6ixu0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607131848-ar6ixu0"}},{"ID":"20240607131854-xkganib","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240607131854-xkganib","updated":"20240607131858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240607131854-8g3vyd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131854-8g3vyd5","updated":"20240607131854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦，微寒，无毒。主治心腹邪气，小便不利，淋闭，风湿，鬼疰，恶毒。久服补虚羸，轻身，耳目聪明，延年。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131854-qgiwyez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131854-qgiwyez","updated":"20240607131854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（石龙刍一名龙须草，近道水石处皆有之，生于缙云者佳，故又名缙云草。苗丛生直上，并无枝叶，状如棕心草。夏月茎端作小穗，开花结细实，赤色。吴人多栽莳之以织席。）"}]},{"ID":"20240607131854-x5ua773","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131854-x5ua773","updated":"20240607131854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙刍气味苦寒，生于水石间，得少阴水精之气化，故以龙名。又，龙能行泄其水精也，主治心腹邪气者，少阴水精之气，上交于心，则心腹之邪气可治也。小便不利，淋闭者，热邪下注而病淋，浊气不化而仍闭结，皆为小便不利。龙刍能启水精之气，上交于心，上下相交，则小便自利矣。又，少阴神气外浮，则能去风湿。少阴神气五内，则能除鬼疰也。又曰∶恶毒者，言鬼疰之病，皆恶毒所为，非痈毒也。久服则水火相济，故能补虚羸而轻身。精神充足，故耳目聪明而延年。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131745-y52w722","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607131745-y52w722"}},{"ID":"20240607131819-3jrkdxl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-3jrkdxl","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：石龙刍"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-yc1a25n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-yc1a25n","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-n06ccw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-n06ccw3","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shí Lónɡ Chú"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-2t6xrc3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-2t6xrc3","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-z1slp3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-z1slp3g","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 龙须、草续断、龙珠（《本经》），龙蒭、龙鬓、龙木、草毒、龙华，悬菟（《吴普本草》），龙须草、缙云草（崔豹《古今注》），龙修（《山海经》郭璞注），悬莞、方宾（《别录》），席草（《本经逢原》），草龙蒭（汪连仕《采药书》），胡须草、野席草（《浙江民间草药》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-9babvuw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-9babvuw","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-6levm23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-6levm23","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-d298p6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-d298p6l","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-uvw06ov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-uvw06ov","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为灯心草科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"石龙刍"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全草"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏、秋采集，晒干或鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-drdokxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-drdokxx","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-ts5nl6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-ts5nl6r","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生长于水田中及潮湿地区。分布广西、浙江等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-aawdhko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-aawdhko","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-r9nxf5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-r9nxf5z","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多年生草本，高达1米余，根茎横走。茎圆筒状，细长，下部有茶褐色鳞片状叶，聚伞花序侧生于茎的一面。由多数小花缀成，花淡绿色，具短柄；花被6，排列为2轮；雄蕊6；子房上位，花柱短，柱头3枚。蒴果，内含种子多数。花期夏季。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-p424xf1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-p424xf1","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本植物的根茎（石龙刍根）亦供药用，另详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-5rw1nfa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-5rw1nfa","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-02l49u9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-02l49u9","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 石龙刍含水分7.14％、蜡及脂肪质2.63％、果胶1.52％、半纤维素13.54％、木质素17％、纤维素52.18％、灰分1％、戊聚糖13.4％。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-zp0d19c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-zp0d19c","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"绿色的茎含赭朴吩1.07％、葡萄糖3.04％、戊聚糖20.09％、甲基戊聚糖1.5％。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-dxd17tu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-dxd17tu","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶含木犀草素-7-葡萄糖甙。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-dsokgv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-dsokgv3","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-zoe06mv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-zoe06mv","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《得配本草》：\"入手少阴、太阴经气分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-7dxho3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-7dxho3w","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-knv9cbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-knv9cbx","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-t8qepll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-t8qepll","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味苦，微寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-067qrzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-067qrzl","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》：\"雷公：苦，无毒。扁鹊：辛，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-ufh0m3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-ufh0m3k","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》：\"微温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-l2x7b6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-l2x7b6w","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《浙江民间草药》：\"味酸，性寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-1dn72qh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-1dn72qh","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-w2xzhbb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-w2xzhbb","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 利水，通淋。治淋病，小便不利。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-js3hlw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-js3hlw3","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主心腹邪气，小便不利，淋闭，风湿。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-e5go0oj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-e5go0oj","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"补内虚不足，痞满，身无润泽，出汗，除茎中热痛。又主疗蛔虫及不消食。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-pu8ipdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-pu8ipdn","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③汪连仕《采药书》：\"散风火，大理湿热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-8dg4y55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-8dg4y55","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《浙江民间草药》：\"利水通淋，清热安神。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-znaemcq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-znaemcq","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-wy8lhj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-wy8lhj6","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3～5钱；或烧存性研末。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-c4pdzix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-c4pdzix","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-2cozq0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-2cozq0i","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①通淋：胡须草、木通各三钱，车前草、甘草各二钱。煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-reweqh7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-reweqh7","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治小儿夜啼：石龙刍（干草），烧灰涂乳上饲小儿。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-zkkjbk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-zkkjbk5","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治牙痛：胡须草三钱，煎服。（选方出《浙江民间草药》）似龙须，但多节，似以为二物者非矣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-6uqp1wp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-6uqp1wp","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-rr3kjj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-rr3kjj7","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-ks5nhhu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-ks5nhhu","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：石龙刍"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-m1j2amo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-m1j2amo","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-anuh0mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-anuh0mc","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shí Lónɡ Chú"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-jl0yqox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-jl0yqox","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-z1k1jgi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-z1k1jgi","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 龙须、草续断、龙珠、龙鬓、龙木、草毒、龙华、悬菟、龙须草、缙云草、龙修、悬莞、方宾、席草、草龙zou、胡须草、野席草"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-0h1ld5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-0h1ld5k","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-exuaq8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-exuaq8l","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" pith of Common Rush"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-ofp9fzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-ofp9fzy","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-hqng4v5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-hqng4v5","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自1.《本经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-y6vqber","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-y6vqber","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：石龙刍，九节多珠者良，生梁州山谷湿地。五月、七月采茎暴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-ivn8w4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-ivn8w4j","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《纲目》：《本经》明言龙刍一名龙须，而陶弘景言龙刍似龙须，但多节，似以为二物者非矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-47osb1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-47osb1p","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-k9wrivf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-k9wrivf","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为灯心草科植物野灯心草的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-p5qtwpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-p5qtwpz","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Juncus setchuensis Buchen.[J.setchuensisBuchen.var.effusoides Buchen.]"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-zb1wx6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-zb1wx6t","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年均可采，去根，杂质，洗净，切段，鲜用或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-xla7xvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-xla7xvd","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-ky5m9ip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-ky5m9ip","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于山沟、道旁的浅水处。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-g7r0ouh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-g7r0ouh","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于长江中、下游及陕西、、四川、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-epkha69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-epkha69","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-l9x3muk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-l9x3muk","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 石龙刍，多年生草本，高30-50cm。根茎多短缩，须根较坚硬。茎细弱，直径0.8-1.5mm，灰绿色，有纵条纹。叶多基生；叶鞘红褐色至棕褐色，长2-5cm，上部有膜质边缘；叶片退化为芒刺状。花序假侧生，聚伞花序，多花或仅有数朵；与茎贯连的苞片直或弯曲，长10-15cm；花被片6，卵状披针形，长2-3mm，淡绿色，近等长，边缘膜质，排列为2轮；雄蕊3，短于花被；子房上位，花柱极短，柱头3。蒴果近球形，成熟时棕褐我，直径约2mm，由于子房内隔膜发育不完全，故为1室。种子偏斜倒卵形，长约0.5mm。花、果期5-6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-j7ak68p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-j7ak68p","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-36b5fyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-36b5fyj","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生物学特性 适应性较强，可利用溪沟边、塘边水浅处和低洼地的潮湿处栽培。 栽培技术 用分株繁殖法。四川地区在12月或1月栽种。耕翻土地，施土杂肥。先将老蔸挖起，分成小蔸，按行、株距各约30cm栽种。 田间管理 每年在3、5月各除草1次，除草后，各施人畜粪水1次。至9-10月收获后，再除草1次，施以土杂肥过冬，并保持湿润或浅水。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-5mscua5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-5mscua5","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-yxa1808","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-yxa1808","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 茎细长圆柱形，长30-50cm，直径1-1.6mm，上部渐细尖，基部稍粗，表面淡黄绿色，光滑，具细纵直纹理。质坚韧，断面黄白色，中央有髓，白色而疏松。茎上部无叶，侧生淡紫色花序或果穗，基部叶鞘红褐色至棕褐色。气微，味淡。 以身干、细匀、色绿者为佳。 显微鉴别 茎横切面：表皮细胞1列，外被角质层，下皮纤维位于棱角处，非木化或微木化。维管束有限外韧型，有维管束鞘纤维；木质部呈“V”字形。髓部大，薄壁细胞5-7分枝，相边成网状，细胞间隙大。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-yfo9m7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-yfo9m7y","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-l3zkmux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-l3zkmux","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 心；小肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-2hwt998","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-2hwt998","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-jfugxzm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-jfugxzm","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦；凉"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-jxlpavu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-jxlpavu","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-yavzje1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-yavzje1","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《饮片新参》：“溲多者勿用。”"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-jl4zd95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-jl4zd95","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-htld3q2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-htld3q2","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 利水通淋；泄热；安神；凉血止血。主热淋；肾炎水肿；心热烦躁；心悸失眠；口舌生疮；咽痛；齿痛；目赤肿痛；衄血；咯血；尿血"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-ojhvo55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-ojhvo55","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-53eey1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-53eey1u","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：9-15g；煎服；或烧存性研末。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-he11370","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-he11370","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-syja4ei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-syja4ei","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主心腹邪气，小便不利，淋闭，风湿。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-m5sry8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-m5sry8o","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：补内虚不足，痞满，身无润泽，出汗，除茎中热痛。又主疗蛔虫及不消食。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-1tjnn9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-1tjnn9k","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.汪连仕《采药书》：散风火，大理湿热。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-p9s0p76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-p9s0p76","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《浙江民间草药》：利水通淋，清热安神。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-s2543fd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-s2543fd","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607131819-ks9egch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131819-ks9egch","updated":"20240607131819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607131820-zdwtwcq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607131820-zdwtwcq"}},{"ID":"20240607131939-9f4fr4v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-9f4fr4v","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：龙须草"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-ao6byfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-ao6byfm","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-x8imuwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-x8imuwe","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lónɡ Xū Cǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-74sib93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-74sib93","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-8fcg3nh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-8fcg3nh","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 野席草（《纲目拾遗》），野灯芯草、马棕根，野马棕、野灯草（《浙江民间常用草药》），鬼尖头草（《上海常用中草药》），灯心草（《安徽药材》），水通草、秧草根（《云南中草药》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-s2agp4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-s2agp4n","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-rexq7xl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-rexq7xl","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《纲目拾遗》"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-9e08q9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-9e08q9y","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-lpo3nnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-lpo3nnw","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为灯心草科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拟灯心草"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全草"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。9～10月间，割取地上部分，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-ioylks3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-ioylks3","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-ydfdzgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-ydfdzgo","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生长于潮湿地及沼泽边缘。分布江苏、安徽、浙江、湖南、四川等地。产江苏、浙江、安徽等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-37w63rj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-37w63rj","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-y4qkjjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-y4qkjjn","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多年生草本。地下有匍匐根茎。茎青绿色，线形，高达50厘米，表面有凸起的条纹。茎上无叶，但于基部有红棕色、淡黄色或暗黑色的鞘状鳞叶数枚。花序侧生，成簇状，伞形或复聚伞形，有短柄；花被6，2列，淡绿色。萼片状；雄蕊通常3枚，着生于花被的基部；子房上位，1室，花柱不明显，柱头3枚，线形。蒴果长椭圆形，内含多数种子。花期4～6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-ogya1hw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-ogya1hw","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-28scnil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-28scnil","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥的茎，呈扁压状细柱形或线形，长30～50厘米，直径1～1.5毫米，先端渐尖，近基部稍粗，表面光滑，淡黄绿色，具纵直细纹理。质坚实而柔软。断面黄白色，中央有白色疏松的髓，但不发达。气无，味淡。以干燥均匀、带绿色者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-794cdee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-794cdee","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-idh84mp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-idh84mp","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 淡，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-m5od8i5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-m5od8i5","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《饮片新参》：\"淡，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-cqch6bv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-cqch6bv","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药材资料汇编》：\"苦，微寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-at09sz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-at09sz6","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《浙江民间常用草药》：\"性寒，味淡。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-c3xn4g7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-c3xn4g7","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《上海常用中草药》：\"甘，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-spfe60n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-spfe60n","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-skb5b8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-skb5b8o","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《饮片新参》：\"溲多者勿用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-a7bmdhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-a7bmdhv","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-a943sl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-a943sl4","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 利尿通淋，泄热安神。治小便赤涩，热淋，肾炎水肿，头昏，齿痛，鼻衄，咽痛，心烦失眠，消渴，梦遗。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-0aw1lua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-0aw1lua","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《饮片新参》：\"渗湿热，利尿通淋。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-e7gjyh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-e7gjyh2","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《安徽药材》：\"利湿热，散风火，止血。治痛风、鼻出血、血崩、小便频数短赤、咽痛、耳痛、梦遗。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-hmfsqti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-hmfsqti","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药材资料汇编》：\"治口腔炎症及齿痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-n011fpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-n011fpp","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《浙江民间常用草药》：\"清热安神。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-ct5dk7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-ct5dk7i","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《上海常用中草药》：\"治小便不利，尿道发热刺痛，肾炎水肿，失眠，心悸，心烦。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-2p9tdtv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-2p9tdtv","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-f0u7gpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-f0u7gpu","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，0.3～1两。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-3moxkdq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-3moxkdq","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-qnv3ci8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-qnv3ci8","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治尿路感染：龙须草、水前草各一两，土茯苓三钱；或龙须草、小蓟草、乌蔹莓各一两，白茅根二两。水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-kif1y7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-kif1y7c","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治失眠，神经衰弱：鲜龙须草二两，夜交藤一两，丹参五钱。水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-a69r1cp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-a69r1cp","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治糖尿病：龙须草二两，鹿茸草一两。水煎服。（选方出《浙江民间常用草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-yb6xvqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-yb6xvqg","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-ok1ku34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-ok1ku34","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-pnyuz3b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-pnyuz3b","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：龙须草"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-9d5kjs8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-9d5kjs8","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-icvry7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-icvry7h","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lónɡ Xū Cǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-bod3js6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-bod3js6","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-s3aqure","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-s3aqure","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《内蒙古中草药》"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-hhdrszm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-hhdrszm","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-pbiuuek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-pbiuuek","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为禾本科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"硬质早熟禾"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"地上部分"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏、秋采收，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-sadplxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-sadplxt","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-4hgm5tg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-4hgm5tg","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生于草地、路旁、林下，山坡和丘陵坡地。分布东北、华北、西北和华东的山东，江苏。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-8wysq1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-8wysq1z","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-2tes1sy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-2tes1sy","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多年生草本，高30～60厘米。秆直立，丛生，坚韧而粗糙，具3～4节。叶片线形，扁平，稍粗糙，长3～7厘米，宽0.5～1毫米；有长叶鞘，无毛，无脊；叶舌膜质，先端锐尖，长约4毫米。圆锥花序，稠密而紧缩，狭长矩形至线形，长3～10厘米，宽约1厘米；小穗披针形，长约4毫米，绿色，成熟后草黄色，含4～6小花；颖披针形，先端锐尖，长2.5～3毫米。颖果纺锤形，腹面有凹沟，长约2毫米。花期6～7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-xhcsjfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-xhcsjfx","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-acwamd3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-acwamd3","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全草含芦竹萜、粘霉酮，无羁萜、β-香树脂醇、羊齿烯醇等三萜类。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-adhsqws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-adhsqws","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-5vop0wh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-5vop0wh","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘淡，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-bt2ehvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-bt2ehvy","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-53ins9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-53ins9f","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热解毒，利尿，止痛。治小便淋涩，黄水疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-jw142rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-jw142rw","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-gf62ff9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-gf62ff9","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治小便淋涩：龙须草二至三钱，水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-a5f52x1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-a5f52x1","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治黄水疮：龙须草穗五钱，蝉蜕二钱，水煎服。（性味以下出《内蒙古中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-9f85mg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-9f85mg9","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607131939-gctv04i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131939-gctv04i","updated":"20240607131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607131940-a0uhz1t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607131940-a0uhz1t"}},{"ID":"20240607131941-fmof8h6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131941-fmof8h6"}}]}